## Use In Work

- Do not re-submit Victor Dunn's $62,000 gangway contingency under P9-GANG without a new cost-code justification distinct from P9-GATE reserves.
- When auditing Pier 9 contingency spend, treat this denial as the authoritative rejection of the duplicate envelope.

## Limits

This rejection covers the $62,000 duplicate gangway contingency only — it does not change Bridgeway mobilization terms, gangway load test requirements, or the P9-GATE **$18400** cap itself.

